ijianzhg/youtube-summariser) and honestly, it&#8217;s working better than I expected.]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">Simplifying the YouTube Summariser: Command-Line First, with Streaming Next</title><link href="https://weijian.ai/blog/2026/simplifying-the-youtube-summariser-command-line-first-with-streaming-next/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Simplifying the YouTube Summariser: Command-Line First, with Streaming Next"/><published>2026-01-01T22:19:46+00:00</published><updated>2026-01-01T22:19:46+00:00</updated><id>https://weijian.ai/blog/2026/simplifying-the-youtube-summariser-command-line-first-with-streaming-next</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://weijian.ai/blog/2026/simplifying-the-youtube-summariser-command-line-first-with-streaming-next/"><![CDATA[]]></content><author><name></name></author><summary type="html"><![CDATA[We need to simplify!]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">Reviving a YouTube Summariser with CLI Support and Model Upgrades</title><link href="https://weijian.ai/blog/2025/reviving-a-youtube-summariser-with-cli-support-and-model-upgrades/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Reviving a YouTube Summariser with CLI Support and Model Upgrades"/><published>2025-12-31T23:00:45+00:00</published><updated>2025-12-31T23:00:45+00:00</updated><id>https://weijian.ai/blog/2025/reviving-a-youtube-summariser-with-cli-support-and-model-upgrades</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://weijian.ai/blog/2025/reviving-a-youtube-summariser-with-cli-support-and-model-upgrades/"><![CDATA[]]></content><author><name></name></author><summary type="html"><![CDATA[I want to take a pretty simple idea from a project I did about nine months ago.]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">The Power of Incentives - Psychology</title><link href="https://weijian.ai/blog/2024/the-power-of-incentives-psychology/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="The Power of Incentives - Psychology"/><published>2024-12-09T18:25:23+00:00</published><updated>2024-12-09T18:25:23+00:00</updated><id>https://weijian.ai/blog/2024/the-power-of-incentives---psychology</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://weijian.ai/blog/2024/the-power-of-incentives-psychology/"><![CDATA[]]></content><author><name></name></author><summary type="html"><![CDATA[As Benjamin Franklin astutely observed, "If you would persuade, appeal to interest and not to reason." This principle underlies the fundamental mechanics of both individual conduct and institutional progress.]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">Big Debt Cycle - Economics</title><link href="https://weijian.ai/blog/2024/big-debt-cycle-economics/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Big Debt Cycle - Economics"/><published>2024-10-29T16:38:56+00:00</published><updated>2024-10-29T16:38:56+00:00</updated><id>https://weijian.ai/blog/2024/big-debt-cycle---economics</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://weijian.ai/blog/2024/big-debt-cycle-economics/"><![CDATA[]]></content><author><name></name></author><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Ray Dalio&#8217;s Big Debt Cycle is a simple yet powerful framework for understanding how the economy works.]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">Prospect Theory - Psychology</title><link href="https://weijian.ai/blog/2024/prospect-theory-psychology/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Prospect Theory - Psychology"/><published>2024-10-06T22:02:54+00:00</published><updated>2024-10-06T22:02:54+00:00</updated><id>https://weijian.ai/blog/2024/prospect-theory---psychology</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://weijian.ai/blog/2024/prospect-theory-psychology/"><![CDATA[]]></content><author><name></name></author><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Imagine you're offered a choice between two options:]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">Entropy - Mathematics</title><link href="https://weijian.ai/blog/2024/entropy-mathematics/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Entropy - Mathematics"/><published>2024-09-29T13:04:51+00:00</published><updated>2024-09-29T13:04:51+00:00</updated><id>https://weijian.ai/blog/2024/entropy---mathematics</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://weijian.ai/blog/2024/entropy-mathematics/"><![CDATA[]]></content><author><name></name></author><summary type="html"><![CDATA[What&#8217;s the most effective way to communicate a message?]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">Compound Interest - Economics</title><link href="https://weijian.ai/blog/2024/compound-interest-economics/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Compound Interest - Economics"/><published>2024-09-22T18:03:18+00:00</published><updated>2024-09-22T18:03:18+00:00</updated><id>https://weijian.ai/blog/2024/compound-interest---economics</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://weijian.ai/blog/2024/compound-interest-economics/"><![CDATA[]]></content><author><name></name></author><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Compound interest is the eighth wonder of the world.]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">Kelly criterion - Economics</title><link href="https://weijian.ai/blog/2024/kelly-criterion-economics/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Kelly criterion - Economics"/><published>2024-09-15T07:09:52+00:00</published><updated>2024-09-15T07:09:52+00:00</updated><id>https://weijian.ai/blog/2024/kelly-criterion---economics</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://weijian.ai/blog/2024/kelly-criterion-economics/"><![CDATA[]]></content><author><name></name></author><summary type="html"><![CDATA[In both investing and gambling one formula rises above the rest for optimising long-term wealth growth: the Kelly Criterion.]]></summary></entry></feed>